			(property "Description" "TPS210x - Power Distribution Switch (OR'ing switch)\n\nCharacteristics:\n\n• Vin: 2.7V ~ 5.5V\n• Iout: 500mA (In1), 100mA (In2)\n• Ron: 250m&Omega; (In1), 1.3 &Omega; (In2)\n•  Switch Topology: 2:1\n•  IQ: 0.75&mu;A typ, 18&mu;A max\n• Operating Temperature: -40°C to 85°C\n\nTPS2104/5 Inverted vs non-inverted enable pin\n\nDigikey:\n\nTPS2105 296-10883-1-ND\nTPS2104 296-10882-1-ND"
